---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { notes } from '../data/notes'
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">计算机硕士 · 计算机视觉与医学影像</p>
      <h1 id="intro-title">你好，我是 <span>Xiiiing</span><span class="hero-period">.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-statement">在学习中记录，<br />在实践中构建。</p>
      <p class="hero-description">这里连接我的知识库、研究笔记与实践。<br class="desktop-break" />慢慢学，慢慢记，也把想法一点点做出来。</p>
      <div class="hero-links"><a class="primary-link" href="/wiki/">进入我的 Wiki <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/me/">认识一下 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-aside"><img class="avatar" src="/images/avatar.jpg" alt="Xiiiing 使用的猫咪头像" width="184" height="184" /><span class="aside-caption">保持好奇，持续积累。</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="spaces-section" id="spaces" aria-labelledby="spaces-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE</p><h2 id="spaces-title">我的数字空间</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">全部项目 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="space-list">
      <a class="space-row space-active" href="/wiki/"><span class="space-index">01</span><div><div class="space-name"><h3>Wiki</h3><span class="status status-live">持续记录</span></div><p>研究、工程与算法的知识整理。从阅读中积累，在实践中验证。</p></div><span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <div class="space-row"><span class="space-index">02</span><div><div class="space-name"><h3>UI 库</h3><span class="status">筹备中</span></div><p>界面的实际效果、对应 prompt，以及从初稿到实现的过程。</p></div><span class="space-kind">UI / PROMPTS</span></div>
      <div class="space-row"><span class="space-index">03</span><div><div class="space-name"><h3>Lab</h3><span class="status">筹备中</span></div><p>把小想法做成可以使用的工具、可视化和交互实验。</p></div><span class="space-kind">EXPERIMENTS</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="notes-section" aria-labelledby="notes-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED NOTES</p><h2 id="notes-title">从这些笔记开始</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/wiki/Research/">研究笔记 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="note-list">{notes.map(note => <a class="note-row" href={note.href}><div><span class="note-category">{note.category}</span><h3>{note.title}</h3><p>{note.description}</p></div><div class="note-meta"><time datetime={note.date}>{note.date.replaceAll('-', '.')}</time><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="closing"><p>知识流动促成长，记录沉淀筑认知。</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Xiiiing">在 GitHub 上找到我 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</BaseLayout>
